4. External dependencies
------------------------
Some samples or features declare dependencies on external open-source packages
(for example via `package.json`, NuGet, or similar) that are fetched at build
or install time rather than stored in this repository. Those packages are
owned by their respective authors and governed by their own licenses. The MIT
grant in section 1 covers only the sample code in this repository, not any
external dependency it may pull in.

If code is later added to this repository under different terms, that code
carries its own license and this file will be updated to point to it.

